    <briefdescription>
<para>Lock-free SPSC (Single Producer Single Consumer) ring buffer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Thread-safe for one writer and one reader. Uses atomic operations for synchronization without mutexes.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Element type </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Capacity</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Buffer capacity (must be power of 2) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
